    "enUS": {
      "description": "On the corpse of the fallen abomination, you discover a cracked crystal, slowly pulsing with necrotic energy.",
      "dialogue": {
        "7459306fb7c469752521": "Is there something you need?",
        "8d940e25cd4ee3f61c45": "Hm, you took this from the corpse of one of the invading abominations?$b$bWe have received word about the necropolis base camps that are being summoned by the Scourge. I suspect they wanted to create one inside Stormwind. It is good that they were unsuccessful."
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Cracked Necrotic Crystal to Lieutenant Orrin outside the gates of Stormwind.",
      "title": "Cracked Necrotic Crystal",
